Description: xcb: fix for multi-X11Screen systems via xrandr 1.5
 Fix support for systems with several X11 screens (for example DISPLAY=:0.0
 and :0.1). Select the primary screen before notifying QWindowSystemInterface
 and keep the primary virtual desktop's screens first in the screen list.
 .
 Adapted for this Qt 6.8.0 source tree by also removing the early return
 that skips non-primary X11 screens. The resulting primary-screen selection
 and screen notification logic follows the upstream change.
Author: Alexander Golubev <fatzer2@gmail.com>
Origin: backport, https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtbase/+/606795
Bug: https://bugreports.qt.io/browse/QTBUG-110898
Bug: https://bugreports.qt.io/browse/QTBUG-130714
Applied-Upstream: commit:64590233aff4f7e9797f37484dbdd6d8465a1ea9
